      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Lucy Tui Hampton Aitken {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} (née Flower, 23 November 1925 – 15 August 2017), generally known as Tui Flower, was a pioneering New Zealand food writer. She has been described as \"New Zealand's Julia Child\".",
